Error [E0133]: `+` isn't defined between `VVar` and `Decimal`
  --> tests/ui/layout_axis_mismatch.jet:6:29
    |
  6 |         label.left >= label.height + 8.0
    |                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Decimal` supports `+`, `-`, `*`, and `==`/`!=` on matching values only
 Fix: Use a method like `.add(other)` or make both operands the same precise type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0133
